 4. 💰 Post-pandemic surprise 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Federal Reserve Survey of Consumer Finances. Chart: Neil Irwin/Axios A surprising finding from one of the most thorough datasets on American household finances , released Friday morning by the Fed:

 Middle- and lower-earners' inflation-adjusted incomes rose during the post-pandemic years — but high earners saw their incomes fall, Axios chief economic correspondent Neil Irwin writes. Go deeper . 

 
 
